<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BTR Nylex says Melbourne dispute over.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BTR Nylex says Melbourne dispute over.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTR Nylex Ltd, a subsidiary of industrial conglomerate BTR Plc, has resolved the protracted industrial dispute at its Spotswood glass factory in Melbourne, BTR Nylex managing director Philip Aiken said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Aiken declined to quantify the financial impact of the strike on BTR Nylex.</p>
<p>&quot;We had sufficient glass to supply all our customers,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Aiken said the maintenance workers would return to work on Monday. A spokesman for the CEPU was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne Bureau 613-9286-1421</p>
</text>
